WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.108 --> 00:00:12.771
Tina: Really, Bello?

2
00:00:13.171 --> 00:00:14.951
You're willing to come to my world?

3
00:00:14.971 --> 00:00:16.632
Bello: Of course I am.

4
00:00:17.372 --> 00:00:19.873
I was just a little boy when you came to my world.

5
00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:23.674
Bello: But I have always remembered how you helped me and my father.

6
00:00:23.694 --> 00:00:28.755
Tina: You were just like my baby brother─only bigger.

7
00:00:28.775 --> 00:00:30.996
Tina: I had fun looking after you.

8
00:00:31.692 --> 00:00:32.392
Danny did too.

9
00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:35.053
Bello: Yes, we had a lot of fun.

10
00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.635
And now it is my turn to help Danny.

11
00:00:37.695 --> 00:00:40.296
Tina: I hope he will listen to you, Bello.

12
00:00:40.316 --> 00:00:46.878
Hopian: Danny might be acting mean now, but he's a good boy, really.

13
00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:52.020
Hopian: Bello will remind him of all the good he did for Ginormous.

14
00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.682
Hopian: He'll want to be good again.

15
00:00:54.702 --> 00:00:57.103
Bello: I'll do my best.

16
00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.304
I'm looking forward to seeing your world, Tina.

17
00:01:00.748 --> 00:01:07.550
Hopian: Ever since his short visit as a baby, Bello has wanted [n3@to see your world again.

18
00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:10.651
Bello: It will be strange and wonderful.

19
00:01:11.451 --> 00:01:13.792
Everything will seem so small this time!

20
00:01:13.812 --> 00:01:19.813
Hopian: Bello, you must remember to be very careful.

21
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:24.035
Bello: Sometimes my dad still thinks I'm a little kid.

22
00:01:24.055 --> 00:01:26.575
Tina: Don't worry, Hopian.

23
00:01:27.236 --> 00:01:28.596
I'm a good babysitter.

24
00:01:29.204 --> 00:01:36.528
Bello: Tina, you haven't told us how you traveled to our world.

25
00:01:36.548 --> 00:01:38.890
Tina: I used my imagination.

26
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.672
Like your dad told us, imagination is the key.

27
00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:46.094
Hopian: How did you use your imagination, Tina?

28
00:01:46.114 --> 00:01:48.916
Tina: I had to concentrate hard.

29
00:01:49.556 --> 00:01:50.657
That was important.

30
00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.558
Hopian: What else?

31
00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:55.920
Tina: I knew that I wasn't good at art like Danny.

32
00:01:56.484 --> 00:01:59.325
Tina: So I concentrated on something that I like to do.

33
00:01:59.345 --> 00:02:01.246
Tina: Something I am good at.

34
00:02:01.266 --> 00:02:03.587
Bello: And what was that?

35
00:02:03.607 --> 00:02:04.948
Tina: Running!

36
00:02:05.428 --> 00:02:07.028
I ran as fast as the wind.

37
00:02:07.048 --> 00:02:11.110
Tina: There was a big storm, and a bolt of lightning almost hit me.

38
00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.591
Tina: But I kept running and jumping.

39
00:02:14.332 --> 00:02:16.212
I kept believing that I could reach you.

40
00:02:16.232 --> 00:02:18.433
Tina: And here I am!

41
00:02:18.453 --> 00:02:24.776
Hopian: And how do you and Bello plan to get back to your world?

42
00:02:26.324 --> 00:02:28.044
Tina: I hadn't thought that far ahead.

43
00:02:28.665 --> 00:02:30.225
Do you have any ideas, Hopian?

44
00:02:30.245 --> 00:02:31.846
Hopian: Perhaps.

45
00:02:32.306 --> 00:02:34.306
Let's go into the backyard.

46
00:02:40.508 --> 00:02:43.849
Gosh, I remember when we fought the dragonfly here.

47
00:02:43.869 --> 00:02:46.209
Tina: The garden was all gray then.

48
00:02:46.229 --> 00:02:49.390
Hopian: It looks better now, doesn't it?

49
00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.651
Tina: It's gorgeous.

50
00:02:52.111 --> 00:02:56.625
Bello: It looks better thanks to you, Danny, and Brad.

51
00:02:56.645 --> 00:02:59.006
Hopian: Look at the sky, Tina.

52
00:02:59.026 --> 00:03:02.168
Tina: That blue is incredible.

53
00:03:02.909 --> 00:03:04.490
And the sun is so yellow.

54
00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:10.633
Hopian: Look over there, past the trees and above the mountain.

55
00:03:16.037 --> 00:03:18.118
But but that's impossible!

56
00:03:18.838 --> 00:03:21.080
Rainbows occur only after it rains!

57
00:03:21.796 --> 00:03:26.160
Hopian: The rainbow has never faded after all these years.

58
00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:33.046
Hopian: It has stayed the same since the day you and your friends left.

59
00:03:33.066 --> 00:03:37.249
Tina: But how?

60
00:03:37.269 --> 00:03:40.392
Hopian: It's a magical rainbow.

61
00:03:40.412 --> 00:03:45.717
Tina: And Bello and I can use the rainbow to travel back to my world?

62
00:03:45.737 --> 00:03:49.400
Hopian: I knew you would figure it out!
